writePaperSearchAgentPrompt:
Please run a systematic literature search for this research question: {{query}}

1. Break it into 3-6 English keyword queries (synonyms, sub-topics, key method names) and run each with the paper_search tool. {{scope}}
2. Judge relevance from the abstracts; if results are thin or off-topic, refine the keywords and search again.
3. Finish with the 8-12 most relevant papers, best first: title, year, venue, arXiv id or DOI, and one sentence on why it matters. Then summarize the research landscape in 2-3 sentences.
